ucture.\n- **Not somber:** There is no sense of mourning or solemnity; the tone is celebratory and respectful.\n\n→ **Conclusion:** Formal yet celebratory — consistent with a prestigious award ceremony.\n\n---\n\n**5) Interactions Between People:**\n\n- **Conversing/Nodding:** In audience shots (e.g., Frame 11–22), people are seen smiling at each other, nodding, and sharing moments of enjoyment — indicating social engagement and shared experience.\n- **Ignoring:** No evidence of people ignoring each other or the event; interactions are positive and context-appropriate.\n- **On stage:** Interactions during award presentations (Frames 7–10, 27–30) are formal but warm — handshakes, bows, and mutual applause.\n\n→ **Conclusion:** Positive, respectful, and socially engaged interactions.\n\n---\n\n**Temporal Sequence and Context:**\n\nAcross all 30 frames — spanning wide shots of the stage, close-ups of the audience, and award presentation moments — the mood remains consistently **engaged, respectful, and celebratory**. There is no temporal shift toward boredom or disinterest. The ceremony’s structure (speeches, presentations, applause) naturally elicits attentive and positive responses from the audience.\n\n---\n\n**Final Determination:**\n\nThe mood of the people at the scene is **most of the time**:\n> **Attentive, respectful, and engaged — with moments of celebration and enjoyment.**\n\nThis directly contradicts the label **'2' (Bored, not interested)**.\n\n✅ **Answer: '2' is incorrect.**"}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 89, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_4564.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_4565.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_4566.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_4567.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_4568.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/