visible distractions (e.g., looking at phones, talking among themselves, or looking away).\n\n**4) Overall atmosphere:**\n\n- **Formal and celebratory.** The setting includes tuxedos, formal gowns, a decorated stage, and a podium with the Nobel emblem.\n- The presence of applause, smiles, and ceremonial decor (flowers, banners) suggests a festive and prestigious occasion, not a somber or dull one.\n\n**5) Interactions between people:**\n\n- **Polite, positive interactions.** People are seen smiling at each other (e.g., Frame 1, 13, 26), clapping in unison, and occasionally waving or nodding (e.g., Frame 15).\n- No signs of ignoring or disengagement; interactions are respectful and celebratory.\n\n---\n\n**Temporal Sequence & Context:**\n\nAcross the 30 frames, the mood remains consistently positive and engaged. The ceremony alternates between moments of applause, formal address, and recipient recognition — all met with appropriate, respectful, and often joyful responses from the audience and participants.\n\nEven during quieter moments (e.g., Frames 9–12, 21–25), the audience remains attentive, not bored. The repeated clapping and smiling across different groups of people confirms sustained interest.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**\n\nThe mood of the people at the scene is **engaged, respectful, and celebratory** — consistent with a prestigious formal event like the Nobel Prize ceremony. There is no evidence to support the claim that people were “bored or not interested.”\n\n✅ Therefore, **answer ‘2’ is incorrect**. A more accurate answer would be something like “Attentive and respectful” or “Celebratory and formal.”\n', "\n=== Batch 30-60 (30 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1155.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1156.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1157.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1158.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvb